nk\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"694a41b0cb75249b\" href=\"?note=694a41b0cb75249b\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-zfc-topo9-valdivia-compactum-—-ZFC-Topo9-Valdivia-Compactum\">df-zfc-topo9-valdivia-compactum — ZFC Topo9 Valdivia Compactum</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (compact Hausdorff space), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> (index set), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_\\Pi\">\\(\\tau_\\Pi\\)</span> (product topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]^\\Gamma\">\\([0,1]^\\Gamma\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_I\">\\(\\tau_I\\)</span> (standard topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,1]\">\\(I=[0,1]\\)</span>), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec I(\\gamma)=I\">\\(\\vec I(\\gamma)=I\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\tau_I(\\gamma)=\\tau_I\">\\(\\vec\\tau_I(\\gamma)=\\tau_I\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\)</span> (countable-support part of the cube)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (product-topology and function predicates from dependencies)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9ValdiviaCompactum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9ValdiviaCompactum}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_I)\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_I)\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a> 的唯一通常区间拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma:V\\to V\">\\(\\Sigma:V\\to V\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的初始序数基数函数，不是未声明的额外大小参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}valdivia\\text{-}compactum} \\vdash \\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{z\\in[0,1]^\\Gamma:|\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma:z(\\gamma)\\neq0\\}|\\leq\\omega\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}valdivia\\text{-}compactum} \\vdash \\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{z\\in[0,1]^\\Gamma:|\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma:z(\\gamma)\\neq0\\}|\\leq\\omega\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}valdivia\\text{-}compactum} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9ValdiviaCompactum}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists\\Gamma,e,\\tau_\\Pi,\\tau_e,\\vec I,\\vec\\tau_I\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec I,\\Gamma,\\{[0,1]\\})\\land(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\vec I(\\gamma)=[0,1]))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau_I,\\Gamma,\\{\\tau_I\\})\\land(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\vec\\tau_I(\\gamma)=\\tau_I))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(\\Gamma,\\vec I,\\vec\\tau_I,[0,1]^\\Gamma,\\tau_\\Pi)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S(e,X,\\tau,[0,1]^\\Gamma,\\tau_\\Pi)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_e,e[X],[0,1]^\\Gamma,\\tau_\\Pi)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(e[X],\\tau_e,e[X]\\cap\\Sigma(\\Gamma))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}valdivia\\text{-}compactum} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9ValdiviaCompactum}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\exists\\Gamma,e,\\tau_\\Pi,\\tau_e,\\vec I,\\vec\\tau_I\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec I,\\Gamma,\\{[0,1]\\})\\land(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\vec I(\\gamma)=[0,1]))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau_I,\\Gamma,\\{\\tau_I\\})\\land(\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\vec\\tau_I(\\gamma)=\\tau_I))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(\\Gamma,\\vec I,\\vec\\tau_I,[0,1]^\\Gamma,\\tau_\\Pi)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2TopologicalEmbedding}_S(e,X,\\tau,[0,1]^\\Gamma,\\tau_\\Pi)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_e,e[X],[0,1]^\\Gamma,\\tau_\\Pi)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(e[X],\\tau_e,e[X]\\cap\\Sigma(\\Gamma))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Valdivia compactness requires a topological embedding, not an arbitrary map, and density is taken in the embedded copy <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e[X]\">\\(e[X]\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The cube topology now uses the canonical five-place product-topology predicate with explicit constant carrier and topology families.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zfc-topo9-valdivia-compactum-—-ZFC-Topo9-Valdivia-Compactum","text":"df-zfc-topo9-valdivia-compactum — ZFC Topo9 Valdivia Compactum","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"3639c3f839b6c954","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"890a8458fc69d8c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top